    <string name="bg_perm_title">Keep times right when you travel</string>
    <string name="bg_perm_body">To update automatically when you are not using the app, Android needs “Allow all the time”. Noor checks rarely, with low-power location, so battery use is minimal. You can turn this off at any time.</string>
